<title>UK: India's STC bought 6,000 tonnes of olein - trade.</title>
<headline>India's STC bought 6,000 tonnes of olein - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's State Trading Corporation bought one parcel of palm olein for at $582 a tonne c and f for October 5-20 shipment, European vegetable oil traders said.</p>
<p>The STCs last purchase was on September 10 when they purchased a total of 12,000 tonnes of olein.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
